  "metadata": {
    "source": "MODIS Terra Vegetation Indices 16-Day Global 250m (MOD13Q1 v061), via Google Earth Engine -- real satellite product, distinct from dashboard/data/dicra_ndvi.json (UNDP DiCRA, MP's 52 districts only); the two are never merged. Phase 8.4.",
    "resolution": "250 m native MOD13Q1 pixel, 16-day composite; a per-year value here is the spatial mean over this district's polygon of that year's temporal-mean composite (GEE reduceRegion, bestEffort=True).",
    "crs": "EPSG:4326",
    "method": "ee.ImageCollection('MODIS/061/MOD13Q1').select('NDVI'), filtered to each calendar year, .mean() temporal composite, then ee.Reducer.mean().combine(stdDev).combine(count) spatially over the district polygon at 250 m scale. NDVI band values scaled by MOD13Q1's own documented factor (0.0001). One GEE request per year (not per-scene) to keep this tractable at national scale.",
    "baseline": "2000-2024 (years with zero qualifying MOD13Q1 composites for this district are omitted from the series, never interpolated)",
    "data_quality": "verified-official (real MODIS product)",
    "unit_count": "25 years with real MOD13Q1 composites out of 25 nominal years; per-year pixel counts and std dev in 'annual_ndvi' below (Phase 8.2: never mean-only)",
